                      "\\007\\2!S2!!F:8ed435d9-51cb-44e7-8b0d-ca85e63ca427!But don't worry,!S5! !S2!any\nupgrade you have\nacquired",
                      "\\007\\2!S2!!F:8ed435d9-51cb-44e7-8b0d-ca85e63ca427!should cross over if\nyou pick up the original\nweapon it came from."
